Weeks later, a grieving Hiro inadvertently reactivates Baymax. Following a stray microbot, they discover someone is mass-producing Hiro''s invention. They are attacked by a masked villain, Yokai. Realizing the fire was no accident, Hiro upgrades Baymax with combat armor and recruits Tadashi''s friends to track down the killer. The team eventually unmasks Yokai as Professor Callaghan, who survived the fire using the microbots and let Tadashi die. Callaghan is seeking revenge against tech entrepreneur Alistair Krei, whom he blames for the loss of his daughter, Abigail, during a malfunctioning teleportation portal test.

Callaghan ambushes Krei and activates the unstable portal to destroy his headquarters. The team defeats Callaghan, but Baymax detects Abigail is still alive within the portal. Hiro and Baymax venture into the collapsing anomaly to rescue her. Struck by debris, Baymax is severely damaged and uses his rocket fist to propel Hiro and Abigail to safety, sacrificing himself. Following Callaghan''s arrest, Hiro discovers Baymax''s original healthcare chip clenched in the recovered rocket fist. Hiro rebuilds Baymax, reuniting with his friend, and the group continues to protect the city as Big Hero 6.', '["grief counseling disguised as a superhero movie","older brothers setting the moral bar so high it hurts","talking your best friend out of a revenge arc","a really good hug that resets your entire nervous system"]', 102, 7.7, 'tt2245084', 'Drop everything. Save the world.', 7.7, 16450, '2014-10-24', 18.7417, 'en', 'Big Hero 6', 165000000, 657870525, 'http://movies.disney.com/big-hero-6', 'Released', 'US', '/2mxS4wUimwlLmI1xp6QW6NSU361.jpg', '/4s2d3xdyqotiVNHTlTlJjrr3q0H.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:37:18Z', '2026-04-03T19:14:40Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Vincent is later tasked with entertaining Marsellus''s wife, Mia. After an evening at a retro restaurant, Mia mistakes Vincent''s heroin for cocaine and overdoses. Desperate to avoid Marsellus''s lethal wrath, Vincent rushes her to his drug dealer''s house, where they manage to revive her with an adrenaline shot to the heart.

Meanwhile, aging boxer Butch Coolidge accepts a bribe from Marsellus to throw a fight, but double-crosses him by betting on himself and winning, accidentally killing his opponent. Fleeing with his girlfriend Fabienne, Butch realizes she forgot his prized family heirloom watch. He returns to his apartment, where he finds and kills Vincent. While escaping, Butch encounters Marsellus on the street. A chase leads them into a pawnshop, where the owner captures them and assaults Marsellus. Butch escapes his bonds but returns with a katana to rescue his boss. Marsellus agrees to a truce, provided Butch leaves Los Angeles forever.

In a diner, Jules and Vincent eat breakfast following the briefcase retrieval. Two armed robbers, Pumpkin and Honey Bunny, hold up the restaurant. When they demand the briefcase, Jules overpowers Pumpkin at gunpoint. Having decided to abandon violence due to the morning''s miracle, Jules recites his favorite biblical passage, Ezekiel 25:17. He gives the robbers his own cash and allows them to leave peacefully, choosing mercy over bloodshed. Jules and Vincent walk out together.', '["deciding to change your entire life because of one undeniable miracle","deep philosophical conversations over very average diner food","risking your actual life to retrieve something your dad gave you","professionals who arrive in a suit to calmly fix your terrible mistakes"]', 154, 8.486, 'tt0110912', 'You won’t know the facts until you’ve seen the fiction.', 8.486, 29918, '1994-09-10', 27.2135, 'en', 'Pulp Fiction', 8000000, 213928762, 'https://www.miramax.com/movie/pulp-fiction/', 'Released', 'US', '/vQWk5YBFWF4bZaofAbv0tShwBvQ.jpg', '/suaEOtk1N1sgg2MTM7oZd2cfVp3.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:20Z', '2026-04-03T19:14:30Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

At camp, Mulan initially struggles under the rigorous instruction of Captain Li Shang. However, she uses her intellect to complete an impossible physical challenge, inspiring her fellow recruits—Yao, Ling, and Chien-Po—and earning their respect. Mushu forges a letter sending Shang''s unit to the front lines, but they arrive to find the main Imperial Army annihilated. Ambushed by the massive Hun army in a snowy mountain pass, Mulan cleverly aims a cannon at a nearby peak, triggering an avalanche that buries the enemy. She saves Shang''s life but sustains a severe wound.

While treating her injuries, a medic discovers Mulan''s true sex. Shang spares her from execution because she saved his life, but expels her from the army. Left behind, Mulan realizes that Shan Yu and his elite warriors survived and are heading for the Imperial City. She attempts to warn Shang, but he refuses to listen. During a victory celebration, the Huns emerge, capture the Emperor, and barricade the palace. Mulan leads Yao, Ling, and Chien-Po to infiltrate the palace and successfully rescue the Emperor. Mulan then lures Shan Yu to the roof, where she and Mushu defeat him with a firework. The Emperor and the assembled crowd bow to Mulan in gratitude. Declining a position on the Emperor''s council, she returns home. She presents the Emperor''s gifts to her father, who tosses the artifacts aside to embrace her, declaring that having her as a daughter is his greatest honor.', '["you will text your dad after this","unhinged grandmothers who say exactly what everyone is thinking","training montages that temporarily convince you to start working out","animal sidekicks who desperately need a raise"]', 88, 7.9, 'tt0120762', 'The flower that blooms in adversity is the most rare and beautiful of all.', 7.9, 10330, '1998-06-18', 13.2376, 'en', 'Mulan', 90000000, 304320254, '', 'Released', 'US', '/jAbexAtB0aSfP5Ay4TpWHARyVnG.jpg', '/mUYV0ZdsDEliGaQahcQH1F3grsP.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:49Z', '2026-04-03T19:14:38Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

They immediately face Captain Hook and his pirate crew. Hook obsessively seeks revenge against Peter for severing his hand and feeding it to a ticking crocodile. Meanwhile, a fiercely jealous Tinker Bell tries to have Wendy killed, though Peter intervenes. While the boys explore the island, Peter and Wendy discover Hook has kidnapped Tiger Lily, the local chief''s daughter, to force her to reveal Peter''s hideout. Peter outwits Hook and rescues her.

Exploiting Tinker Bell''s jealousy, Hook tricks her into revealing Peter''s underground hideout at Hangman''s Tree. There, Wendy sings a poignant song about mothers, making her brothers and the Lost Boys homesick. As they leave to return to London, Hook captures them and leaves a time bomb for Peter. Tinker Bell escapes Hook''s clutches and heroically pulls the bomb away from Peter just as it detonates.

Aboard the pirate ship, Peter arrives to save Wendy from walking the plank. He frees the boys, and together they fight off the pirates. Peter defeats Hook, who falls into the water and flees from the hungry crocodile. Covering the ship in pixie dust, Peter sails it through the sky back to London. When the parents return, they find the children asleep. Softening his stance, George agrees Wendy can stay in the nursery a while longer. Gazing out the window, he sees a pirate ship in the clouds and wistfully recognizes it from his own childhood.', '["gentle reminders that growing up is a feature not a bug","dads repenting of their strictness right before the credits roll","little girls practicing being mothers on completely feral boys","toddlers surviving mortal peril while wearing footie pajamas"]', 77, 7.187, 'tt0046183', 'It will live in your heart forever!', 7.187, 5702, '1953-02-05', 6.6674, 'en', 'Peter Pan', 4000000, 87400000, 'https://movies.disney.com/peter-pan', 'Released', 'US', '/fJJOs1iyrhKfZceANxoPxPwNGF1.jpg', '/vwcfvPzYO3Gz975yRXp6DYSSbzo.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:03Z', '2026-04-03T19:15:19Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

The guards receive a new inmate: John Coffey, an imposing Black man sentenced to death for the rape and murder of two young girls. Despite his massive size, Coffey exhibits a gentle, childlike demeanor and a profound fear of the dark. Paul discovers Coffey possesses miraculous abilities when the inmate cures Paul''s severe infection by touching him and exhaling a swarm of dark, moth-like particles. Coffey later resurrects a pet mouse belonging to inmate Eduard Delacroix after Percy maliciously crushes it under his boot.

Convinced of Coffey''s divine gift, Paul and his fellow guards risk everything to smuggle Coffey out of the prison to the home of Warden Hal Moores, whose wife, Melinda, is dying of a brain tumor. Coffey successfully absorbs the tumor but struggles to release the sickness. Back at the prison, Coffey grabs Percy and transfers the affliction into him. The sudden, overwhelming madness causes Percy to fatally shoot another inmate, the chaotic and violent William "Wild Bill" Wharton. Through a shared psychic vision, Coffey reveals to Paul that Wharton is the actual perpetrator of the crimes for which Coffey was condemned. Percy is subsequently committed to an asylum in a catatonic state.

Knowing Coffey is innocent and a true miracle of God, Paul agonizingly offers to let him escape. Coffey gently refuses, explaining that he is exhausted by the constant pain and cruelty of the world and is ready to rest. With heavy hearts, Paul and his men carry out the execution, weeping as they do. In the present day, Paul reveals to Elaine that he is 108 years old and the prison mouse is still alive. Paul believes his unnaturally long life—and the heavy burden of outliving all his loved ones—is a divine punishment for having executed a miracle of God.', '["grown men weeping openly without losing an ounce of dignity","coworkers maintaining strict moral decency in a fundamentally depressing workplace","the profound physical exhaustion of caring too much in a fallen world","you will need a quiet room and a glass of water after this one"]', 189, 8.504, 'tt0120689', 'Paul Edgecomb didn''t believe in miracles. Until the day he met one.', 8.504, 19019, '1999-12-10', 26.8504, 'en', 'The Green Mile', 60000000, 286801374, 'http://thegreenmile.warnerbros.com/', 'Released', 'US', '/8VG8fDNiy50H4FedGwdSVUPoaJe.jpg', '/b6HWTOxn1xevvyHU2K9ICvaRU6g.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:24Z', '2026-04-03T19:15:11Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Determined to prove himself, Roo sneaks out to conduct his own search. Deep in the Hollow, he discovers a playful young Heffalump named Heffridge Trumpler Brompet Heffalump, IV, whom he nicknames "Lumpy". Roo quickly learns that Lumpy is entirely harmless and just as afraid of the Wood''s residents as they are of him. The two spend the afternoon playing and form a strong bond. Wanting to show his friends the truth, Roo brings Lumpy back home. However, Pooh and the others have already returned from their unsuccessful expedition and set up various traps to protect their homes.

When the group spots Lumpy, they mistakenly believe he has kidnapped Roo and aggressively attempt to capture him. Frightened and feeling betrayed, Lumpy flees and falls into one of Rabbit''s traps. Roo rushes to free him, and Kanga watches the two reconcile, quietly realizing her son has simply made a new friend. Roo bravely confronts the adults about their prejudice, but during the commotion, a still-scared Lumpy accidentally knocks Roo into a dangerous pile of heavy logs. Unable to free his friend, Lumpy uses his trunk to trumpet for his mother. Mama Heffalump quickly arrives and easily rescues Roo, proving her gentle and protective nature to the astonished onlookers. Realizing their assumptions were entirely wrong, Rabbit and the others apologize to the Heffalumps, who are warmly welcomed as a permanent part of the Hundred Acre Wood family.', '["children possessing infinitely more common sense than the adults in charge","excellent case studies in the sin of rash judgment","the profound relief of a competent mother arriving to fix everything","small heroes displaying a frankly unreasonable amount of courage","comfort watches for when the world is entirely too loud"]', 68, 6.8, 'tt0407121', 'Heffa nice day.', 6.8, 486, '2005-02-11', 2.7458, 'en', 'Pooh''s Heffalump Movie', 20000000, 52900000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/5kd5JqccroxOnC9sVMP5NtLrbkr.jpg', '/wUFgVDjkSlUwX6ehWhOsy6JSnCx.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:13:43Z', '2026-04-03T19:16:17Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

In the desert, Simba is rescued by a meerkat named Timon and a warthog named Pumbaa. The trio become fast friends, and Simba grows to adulthood living a carefree lifestyle, willfully ignoring his past and his royal duties. Years later, Simba rescues his friends from a hunting lioness, who is revealed to be his childhood friend Nala. Nala informs Simba that Scar has allowed the hyenas to overrun the Pride Lands, causing famine and ecological ruin. She begs Simba to return and claim the throne, but he refuses, still paralyzed by his secret guilt.

Wandering alone, Simba encounters the wise mandrill Rafiki, who guides him to a vision of Mufasa''s spirit. The ghost reminds Simba of who he is and his divine responsibility to his people. Newly resolved, Simba returns to the Pride Lands with Nala, Timon, and Pumbaa. The lionesses unite against Scar and his hyena army. Cornered, Scar confesses to murdering Mufasa, freeing Simba from his lifelong guilt. Simba defeats his uncle in battle, and Scar is killed by his own betrayed hyena minions. Simba ascends Pride Rock and unleashes a mighty roar, reclaiming his rightful throne. Under his rule, the land heals and the animals gather once again to celebrate the birth of Simba and Nala''s new cub.', '["accepting your vocation after a period of intense evasion","running away from your problems until a ghost tells you to go back","the devastating realization that you actually have to grow up and take responsibility","animal sidekicks doing all the heavy lifting for the protagonist''s mental health"]', 89, 8.252, 'tt0110357', 'The greatest adventure of all is finding our place in the Circle of Life.', 8.252, 19525, '1994-06-15', 21.8598, 'en', 'The Lion King', 45000000, 763455561, 'http://movies.disney.com/the-lion-king', 'Released', 'US', '/sKCr78MXSLixwmZ8DyJLrpMsd15.jpg', '/6GF9uJs7AnbcJvyfoZyjZv063Oo.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:40Z', '2026-04-03T19:16:33Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Stranded and out of their element, Duchess and her kittens encounter Thomas O''Malley, a smooth-talking, worldly alley cat who volunteers to guide them back to Paris. During their journey, they face numerous hazards and are aided by various eccentric animals, including a pair of English geese named Abigail and Amelia Gabble. Upon reaching the city, the exhausted family takes shelter in an abandoned building with O''Malley''s friend, Scat Cat, and his lively jazz band. 

When Duchess and the kittens finally return to the mansion, Edgar intercepts them, stuffing them into a sack and preparing to ship them in a trunk to Timbuktu. However, O''Malley, the jazz cats, a courageous house mouse named Roquefort, and the carriage horse Frou-Frou work together to ambush the butler, ultimately locking him in his own shipping trunk. Madame Bonfamille joyfully reunites with her pets, discovers Edgar''s sudden departure, adopts O''Malley into the family, and establishes a charitable foundation to house all the alley cats of Paris.', '["mothers maintaining absolute grace while their children embrace chaos","rogues whose entire personality is actually just being a protective dad","the absolute logistical nightmare of traveling with small children","strangers going dangerously out of their way to help a family in need","villains dramatically overcomplicating extremely simple crimes"]', 78, 7.295, 'tt0065421', 'A tune-filled animated extravaganza.', 7.295, 5325, '1970-12-24', 6.1666, 'en', 'The Aristocats', 4000000, 191000000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/1BVOSmQUhphMgnTxnXyfQ9tL1Sc.jpg', '/oM5mMTGBqsmMJO3l5tkQdQ0Xujm.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:18Z', '2026-04-03T19:16:49Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

After Triton discovers and destroys Ariel''s secret grotto of human treasures, the heartbroken princess is lured to the evil sea witch Ursula. They make a deal: Ursula will transform Ariel into a human for three days in exchange for her voice. Ariel must receive the "kiss of true love" from Eric within three days, or she will turn back into a mermaid and belong to Ursula forever.

Ariel receives human legs and is found by Eric. Though mute, she charms him. They spend time together and nearly kiss, but are thwarted by Ursula''s eels. Fearing Ariel will succeed, Ursula disguises herself as a beautiful woman named Vanessa and uses Ariel''s stolen voice to hypnotize Eric into marrying her. Ariel''s friends discover the deception and interrupt the wedding. The shell holding Ariel''s voice shatters, restoring her speech and breaking Eric''s hypnosis. Eric rushes to kiss her, but the sun sets. She reverts to a mermaid, and Ursula claims her.

Triton trades his own freedom for Ariel''s, allowing Ursula to take his magical trident. Eric arrives to rescue Ariel. In the ensuing battle, Ursula grows to monstrous proportions and creates a massive whirlpool. Eric commandeers a wrecked ship from the vortex and impales Ursula with its splintered bowsprit, killing her. With Ursula dead, Triton and her other victims are freed. Recognizing Eric''s bravery and Ariel''s love, Triton permanently transforms Ariel into a human. Ariel and Eric marry with the blessing of both their worlds.', '["teenagers learning the hard way that their parents were actually right","men fighting literal monsters to protect the women they love","dads sacrificing literally everything to fix their teenagers'' catastrophic mistakes","signing legally binding contracts without reading the fine print"]', 83, 7.35, 'tt0097757', 'Somewhere under the sea and beyond your imagination is an adventure in fantasy.', 7.35, 8354, '1989-11-17', 9.2493, 'en', 'The Little Mermaid', 40000000, 211343479, 'https://movies.disney.com/the-little-mermaid', 'Released', 'US', '/plcZXvI310FkbwIptvd6rqk63LP.jpg', '/qGZXYHvWR1TYOU9raCaEABrj9m7.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:33Z', '2026-04-03T19:17:40Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Gromit soon spots a wanted poster revealing that the penguin is actually Feathers McGraw, a notorious thief who disguises himself as a chicken by wearing a red rubber glove on his head. Feathers secretly rewires the trousers for remote control and forces a sleeping Wallace into them. He marches Wallace to the city museum and uses the wall-walking trousers to bypass the security system, successfully stealing a valuable blue diamond. However, a mishap with the prize triggers the alarm, waking Wallace in a panic.

Feathers marches Wallace back to the house and reveals his true identity, trapping both Wallace and the investigating Gromit in a wardrobe at gunpoint. Using his electronic expertise, Gromit hot-wires the Techno-Trousers to kick open the wardrobe door. A frantic chase ensues as Gromit and Wallace pursue Feathers through the house aboard their extensive model train set. Gromit rapidly lays down spare track pieces just ahead of the moving train to keep up with the fleeing penguin. The pursuit ends when the train collides with the trousers, launching Feathers into the air before Gromit safely catches him in an empty milk bottle. Feathers is handed over to the police and imprisoned at the city zoo. Wallace uses the substantial reward money to pay off his debts, and the two friends share a peaceful cup of tea as the discarded Techno-Trousers activate on their own and walk off into the sunset.', '["dogs who are the only responsible adults in the household","inventors building needlessly complex machines to avoid minor inconveniences","villains whose disguises absolutely should not work but completely do","british characters remaining painfully polite during life threatening situations"]', 30, 7.809, 'tt0108598', 'They’ll crack any case', 7.809, 1142, '1993-12-17', 2.5483, 'en', 'The Wrong Trousers', 832000, 0, 'http://www.wallaceandgromit.com/films/the-wrong-trousers', 'Released', 'GB', '/mV8SDTjkxrDxu0a0egvFz1lRPU7.jpg', '/9AbessEz2YKjmPtYKATDeYRW3Px.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:34:29Z', '2026-04-03T19:17:42Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language 