Atreyu departs with his beloved horse, Artax, but while traversing the Swamps of Sadness, Artax is overcome by despair and sinks into the mud. Atreyu continues alone, meeting Morla the Ancient One, a giant turtle who directs him to the Southern Oracle. During his journey, Atreyu is hunted by a vicious, wolf-like beast called Gmork, but is rescued by Falkor, a flying luck dragon. Falkor and his companions, two gnomes, heal Atreyu and send him to the Oracle. The Oracle reveals that the only way to save the Empress and Fantasia is for a human child from beyond their world to give the Empress a new name.

As the Nothing consumes Fantasia, Atreyu engages in a fierce battle with Gmork, defeating him. The realm crumbles until only fragments remain. The Childlike Empress pleads directly to the reader of the story to call out her new name. Bastian, realizing he is the human child they seek, overcomes his fear and shouts the name Moonchild into the storm. He awakens before the Empress, who presents him with a single grain of sand, all that remains of Fantasia. She tells Bastian that he can restore the realm with his imagination. Bastian wishes Fantasia back into existence, flying on Falkor''s back through the restored world and eventually returning to the real world, where he chases away his bullies.', '["movies that build character through mild childhood trauma","unapologetically weeping over a fictional animal","realizing you are the one who actually has to fix this","processing family grief through epic fantasy side quests"]', 97, 7.2, 'tt0088323', 'A boy who needs a friend finds a world that needs a hero in a land beyond imagination!', 7.2, 4326, '1984-04-06', 6.0648, 'de', 'Die unendliche Geschichte', 27000000, 20158808, '', 'Released', 'DE', '/lWJC8om086h01f0CMGR9ombdpnI.jpg', '/77Lxx8CkJ5KhiwLb0mJqN7coubk.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:13:49Z', '2026-04-03T19:19:52Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Mary discovers the hidden key and the ivy-covered door to the garden, finding it overgrown and neglected. She befriends Dickon, the younger brother of one of the housemaids, Martha. Dickon has a natural affinity for animals and plants, and together they begin secretly tending to the garden, bringing it back to life.

Inside the gloomy manor, Mary hears cries at night and eventually discovers her cousin, Colin Craven. Colin is kept confined to his bed, convinced by his father''s fears and the staff''s coddling that he is gravely ill and will soon develop a hunched back like his father. Mary realizes Colin is merely weak from lack of use and fresh air. She and Dickon sneak Colin out in a wheelchair and bring him into the secret garden. The magic and vitality of the garden inspire Colin to stand and eventually learn to walk.

Meanwhile, Lord Craven, haunted by dreams of his late wife, feels a sudden pull to return home from his travels abroad. He arrives at Misselthwaite Manor and wanders toward the secret garden, drawn by the sound of children playing. Inside, he is astounded to see Colin walking and completely healthy. Lord Craven embraces his son and Mary, and the entire household rejoices as the family is finally healed.', '["children roaming completely unsupervised on massive estates","a stern housekeeper who is actually just trying to do her job","kids fixing the profound emotional damage of the adults around them","going outside cures every physical and emotional ailment"]', 101, 7.42, 'tt0108071', 'The timeless tale of a special place where magic, hope and love grow.', 7.42, 965, '1993-08-13', 2.6787, 'en', 'The Secret Garden', 18000000, 40000000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/zf6h5dJ7wVG7LqMO9dhHGHVejzj.jpg', '/8s7FJ9dHXgeFZdvxfjPmrrJh6EC.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:34:49Z', '2026-04-03T19:20:01Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

In 1949, Andy overhears captain of the guards Byron Hadley complaining about taxes and offers his financial expertise. After the Sisters nearly kill Andy, Hadley severely beats their leader, ending the attacks. Andy is reassigned to assist elderly inmate Brooks in the library, where he manages the staff''s finances and secures state funds to expand the facility. Meanwhile, Brooks is paroled after fifty years but, unable to adjust to the outside world, hangs himself.

By 1963, corrupt warden Samuel Norton exploits prison labor for public works, taking bribes and undercutting contractors. Andy launders the illicit money using the fictitious identity "Randall Stephens". Later, Andy befriends young inmate Tommy Williams, who reveals that a former cellmate confessed to the murders for which Andy was convicted. When Andy asks Norton for help securing a new trial, Norton refuses, places Andy in solitary confinement, and has Tommy murdered to protect his laundering operation.

Upon his release, Andy tells Red of his dream to live in Zihuatanejo, Mexico. The next morning, his cell is empty. He has used his rock hammer to dig a tunnel over nineteen years, concealing the hole behind his posters. Escaping through a sewage pipe, Andy poses as Randall Stephens to withdraw Norton''s funds and mails evidence of the corruption to the press. Hadley is arrested, and Norton commits suicide. When Red is later paroled, he follows instructions Andy left behind, finding cash and an invitation to Zihuatanejo. Red violates his parole, travels to Mexico, and joyfully reunites with his friend.', '["dads standing in the living room holding a tool because they got distracted by the plot","deeply moving male friendships where nobody ever talks about their feelings","the pure unadulterated joy of seeing corrupt bureaucrats get completely ruined","maintaining a quiet, terrifying level of patience"]', 142, 8.718, 'tt0111161', 'Fear can hold you prisoner. Hope can set you free.', 8.718, 30030, '1994-09-23', 42.6474, 'en', 'The Shawshank Redemption', 25000000, 28341469, '', 'Released', 'US', '/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg', '/zfbjgQE1uSd9wiPTX4VzsLi0rGG.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:23Z', '2026-04-03T19:21:13Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Discovering Nick was the last to see Otterton, Judy blackmails him into assisting her. Their investigation leads to a secret asylum holding Otterton and other missing predators, all of whom have reverted to a mindless, feral state. The facility is secretly run by Mayor Lionheart, who is hiding the afflicted citizens to prevent public panic. Lionheart is arrested, and Assistant Mayor Bellwether takes his place. During a press conference, Judy suggests the affliction is due to innate predator biology, deeply offending Nick and sparking widespread discrimination against predators throughout the city.

Plagued by guilt, Judy resigns and returns to her family''s farm in Bunnyburrow. There, she discovers that "Night Howlers"—which she thought were wolves—are actually toxic flowers that cause violent psychotropic effects in any mammal. Realizing the savage predators were poisoned, Judy returns to Zootopia, reconciles with Nick, and uncovers a secret lab manufacturing weaponized Night Howler darts. Judy and Nick expose Bellwether as the mastermind, discovering she orchestrated the crisis to use fear to solidify prey supremacy over predators. Bellwether is arrested, an antidote cures the afflicted citizens, and Nick graduates from the police academy, becoming the city''s first fox officer and Judy''s partner.', '["relentless optimism slowly eroding a cynic''s defenses","dense political thrillers cleverly disguised as children''s entertainment","bureaucracy depicted with frightening accuracy","protagonists who are entirely too competent for their entry level jobs"]', 109, 7.8, 'tt2948356', 'Welcome to the urban jungle.', 7.8, 17901, '2016-02-11', 28.6472, 'en', 'Zootopia', 150000000, 1025521689, 'http://movies.disney.com/zootopia', 'Released', 'US', '/hlK0e0wAQ3VLuJcsfIYPvb4JVud.jpg', '/9tOkjBEiiGcaClgJFtwocStZvIT.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:37:20Z', '2026-04-03T19:20:37Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Discovering that the bounty for capturing Alameda Slim is exactly $750, the cows decide to hunt down the outlaw themselves to save their farm. Meanwhile, a famous bounty hunter named Rico is also tracking Slim. The sheriff''s arrogant horse, Buck, eagerly volunteers to be Rico''s steed, dreaming of heroic glory. The cows set out on their quest, teaming up with a feisty, peg-legged jackrabbit named Lucky Jack. Along the way, the animals face numerous dangers, including Slim''s unique method of rustling: a hypnotic yodel that mind-controls cattle.

The cows eventually corner Slim, but their plan is derailed when they discover that Rico is secretly on the outlaw''s payroll. Disillusioned by his idol''s corruption, Buck switches sides to help the cows and Lucky Jack, freeing the stolen cattle in the process. Slim escapes and attempts to use his ill-gotten wealth to buy Patch of Heaven at auction. However, the mismatched animal alliance catches up to him, overpowering the villains and exposing Slim''s true identity to the authorities. The animals deliver the outlaw to the sheriff, collect the reward money, and return to Patch of Heaven just in time to pay off the bank, securing their home forever.', '["animals doing the heavy lifting because the human adults are completely helpless","meeting your lifelong idol and realizing they lack basic moral virtues","villains committing complex crimes using incredibly silly personal talents","perfectly acceptable background noise for folding massive piles of laundry"]', 76, 6.1, 'tt0299172', 'Bust a moo.', 6.1, 2137, '2004-04-02', 5.2685, 'en', 'Home on the Range', 110000000, 145358062, 'http://movies.disney.com/home-on-the-range', 'Released', 'US', '/9xIIo4FMquy5SRqn8hppyr2QadR.jpg', '/Jghbo8U2XkmGjCfKD9NiMM70ha.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:37:04Z', '2026-04-03T19:21:40Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

In the real world, Bolt attempts to use his powers and fails, attributing his weakness to styrofoam packing peanuts. Believing he must track down Dr. Calico to save Penny, Bolt captures a cynical feral cat named Mittens, convinced she is a villainous agent, and coerces her into guiding him across the country. They are joined by Rhino, a fearless hamster in an exercise ball who is a devoted fan of Bolt''s show and fully believes in his powers.

As they travel west, Mittens teaches Bolt how to enjoy the simple pleasures of being a normal dog, like begging for food and playing fetch. She eventually forces him to realize his entire life is a Hollywood fabrication. Though heartbroken to accept he is ordinary, Bolt remains determined to reunite with Penny. Upon reaching the studio, Bolt watches Penny filming with a lookalike dog and assumes she has replaced him. Before he can leave in despair, an accident ignites a massive fire on the soundstage. When Penny becomes trapped inside the burning building, Bolt rushes into the flames. Staying by her side, Bolt uses a normal bark through the building''s air vent to alert firefighters, leading to their rescue. Disillusioned with show business, Penny quits acting. She adopts Mittens and Rhino, and the family moves to a quiet rural home where Bolt can finally live as a regular dog.', '["method actors who do not know they are acting","dogs setting the loyalty bar so high it feels like a personal attack","realizing you aren''t magic but choosing to be brave anyway","abandoning fame for a quiet family life"]', 98, 6.536, 'tt0397892', 'Fully Awesome.', 6.536, 6446, '2008-11-21', 7.7715, 'en', 'Bolt', 150000000, 309979994, 'http://movies.disney.com/bolt', 'Released', 'US', '/v5aC4nrzXFGJDWY4JO1eengXzqk.jpg', '/zWqxBc6pdSIjklqWfZ70l5ce28P.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:37:10Z', '2026-04-03T19:21:52Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

When the motorcycle engine''s heat causes the snowman to start melting, he cools down in the kitchen''s chest freezer. Seeing a picture of an arctic landscape on a package of frozen food, the snowman takes James by the hand and runs outside, suddenly lifting them both into the air. They fly over the English countryside, past Brighton Pier, and across the ocean to the North Pole. Landing in a snow-covered forest, they join a festive gathering of snowmen from around the world. They eventually meet Father Christmas, who takes James to his workshop and gifts him a blue scarf featuring a snowman pattern.

Before sunrise, the snowman and James fly back home. They bid each other farewell, and James returns to bed. The following morning, James wakes up and rushes outside, only to find that the morning sun has melted the snowman, leaving behind nothing but a pile of slush, the hat, the coal, and the tangerine. Heartbroken, James kneels by the melted snow, reaches into his dressing gown pocket, and pulls out the blue scarf given to him by Father Christmas, proving that the night''s magical adventure was not a dream.', '["captivating a room full of kids without a single line of dialogue","respecting a child''s capacity for melancholy and quiet wonder","gentle introductions to the concept of impermanence","cinematic flights that actually feel like magic"]', 25, 7.6, 'tt0084701', '', 7.6, 345, '1982-12-26', 2.5767, 'en', 'The Snowman', 0, 0, 'https://www.thesnowman.com', 'Released', 'GB', '/b3CMolkeXrPaVvd5vTsssMKfZZo.jpg', '/aNCGvBqqrc9L6JKgujYkc2EKbXH.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:12:24Z', '2026-04-03T19:23:00Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Taran pursues them to the Horned King''s stronghold. Though he helps the pig escape, Taran is thrown into the dungeon. He soon breaks out with the help of Princess Eilonwy, discovering a magical sword in the catacombs. Joined by a comical bard named Fflewddur Fflam and a cowardly but affectionate creature named Gurgi, the companions evade capture and are guided to the underground realm of the Fair Folk, who reveal the Black Cauldron is hidden in the Marshes of Morva.

Journeying to the marshes, the group encounters three eccentric witches. Taran trades his magical sword for the cauldron, only to learn its evil power can only be broken if someone willingly sacrifices their life by climbing inside. Before they can act, the Horned King''s forces ambush them, seizing both the companions and the cauldron.

At the castle, the Horned King uses the relic to unleash his undead army. Gurgi manages to free his captive friends. Seeing the undead marching forth, Taran prepares to jump into the cauldron, but Gurgi throws himself in instead, breaking the curse. The cauldron''s destructive vortex consumes the Horned King and obliterates his castle. The witches soon appear to reclaim the inert cauldron. Taran refuses to take back his magic sword, instead bargaining the cauldron for Gurgi''s resurrection. Reunited, the friends journey back home.', '["farm boys who have absolutely no business fighting a dark lord","giving up your dreams of glory because your friends matter more","the comic relief unexpectedly committing an act of profound self-sacrifice","80s fantasy movies assuming children were emotionally prepared for the grim reality of death"]', 80, 6.427, 'tt0088814', 'Hidden by darkness. Guarded by witches. Discovered by a boy. Stolen by a king. Whoever owns it will rule the world. Or destroy it.', 6.427, 1420, '1985-07-24', 3.1836, 'en', 'The Black Cauldron', 25000000, 21300000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/ef11J5KGMp26kEzeg8ghAKeB65C.jpg', '/4idEU92m0oR1BWa1iwb5pZ9bWCu.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:26Z', '2026-04-03T19:25:41Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

After the bees escape and chase the group to Piglet''s house, they discover he is missing. To track him down, the friends use Piglet''s scrapbook of drawings as a guide. They recount several stories from the book, leading to flashbacks of past adventures: Kanga and Roo''s arrival where Rabbit used Piglet as a decoy, an expedition to the North Pole where Piglet saved a drowning Roo but Pooh inadvertently received the credit, and the time Piglet built a house for Eeyore.

Through these memories, the friends realize they have constantly overlooked Piglet''s bravery. An argument between Tigger and Rabbit results in the scrapbook falling into a river. Without their guide, the guilt-ridden friends return to Piglet''s house and draw new pictures depicting his heroic actions. Inspired by their artwork, they resume the search and find the ruined scrapbook on a hollow log suspended over a raging waterfall. Pooh attempts to retrieve it but falls into the log. Piglet arrives and rushes in to save Pooh, but the log collapses into the waterfall below.

The group mourns, believing both are lost, until Pooh and Piglet emerge safely from the wreckage. Though the scrapbook is destroyed, the friends take Piglet home and show him their new drawings to demonstrate their newfound appreciation. The film concludes with a party honoring Piglet, where Pooh renames Eeyore''s home "Pooh and Piglet Corner" to celebrate the big impact of their smallest friend.', '["tiny characters demonstrating more courage than everyone else combined","the quiet backbone of the friend group finally getting a proper thank you","children''s films featuring unexpectedly harrowing waterfall sequences","movies that serve as a masterclass in how to properly apologize","the cinematic equivalent of a warm hug and a cup of tea"]', 79, 6.7, 'tt0323642', 'A tale you''ll never forget.', 6.7, 394, '2003-03-16', 2.2544, 'en', 'Piglet''s Big Movie', 46000000, 62870546, '', 'Released', 'US', '/cytspPjtacOInHroA6h2dIekDrp.jpg', '/yrIL6TukQ3m2KLf9oFoLMF7kDnz.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:13:38Z', '2026-04-03T19:25:58Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

As both establish solo careers, they constantly sabotage each other. Borden debuts "The Transported Man," appearing to instantly travel between two wardrobes. Angier becomes obsessed with uncovering his secret. He hires a body double to replicate the trick, but his vanity leaves him dissatisfied with taking his bows hidden beneath the stage.

The feud escalates into violence and betrayal. Angier sends his assistant, Olivia, to steal Borden''s diary, but she falls in love with Borden. Borden later sabotages Angier''s act, causing a permanent leg injury. Desperate to win, Angier travels to Colorado to hire inventor Nikola Tesla to build a real teleportation machine. Tesla''s device works, but it duplicates the user. Angier incorporates the machine into his act, secretly drowning his own clone in a hidden water tank during every single performance.

Borden''s personal life simultaneously unravels. His wife, Sarah, driven to despair by his contradictory and secretive behavior, commits suicide. When Borden sneaks backstage to discover the secret of Angier''s new trick, he witnesses Angier drowning in a water tank. Angier frames Borden for the murder, leading to Borden''s trial and execution by hanging.

Following the execution, the supposedly dead Angier reappears as Lord Caldlow to adopt Borden''s daughter. However, he is suddenly confronted and fatally shot by Borden. It is revealed that "Borden" was a shared identity lived by identical twins, who took turns playing the magician and his assistant, Fallon. The surviving brother reunites with his daughter, leaving Angier to die in his burning theater amongst the drowned corpses of his many clones.', '["absolutely no one needed to die but here we are","men who will literally invent new physics just to win an argument","when you could have just been a good father but chose drama instead"]', 130, 8.207, 'tt0482571', 'Are You Watching Closely?', 8.207, 17378, '2006-10-17', 14.369, 'en', 'The Prestige', 40000000, 109676311, 'http://wwws.warnerbros.de/theprestige/', 'Released', 'US,GB', '/Ag2B2KHKQPukjH7WutmgnnSNurZ.jpg', '/qc9zR02j2apoEwMdptMYBoAFYUC.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:35Z', '2026-04-03T19:26:50Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

At the bottom, she encounters a talking doorknob. To fit through its keyhole, Alice consumes mysterious drinks and sweets that alter her size, eventually shrinking enough to enter. She continues her pursuit of the White Rabbit, crossing paths with identical twins Tweedledum and Tweedledee, who recite the tale of the Walrus and the Carpenter. Her journey leads her to a garden of snooty talking flowers and a pompous Caterpillar who speaks in riddles before transforming into a butterfly.

Deep in the woods, Alice encounters the grinning Cheshire Cat, who directs her to the Mad Hatter, the March Hare, and the Dormouse. She joins them at an absurd "unbirthday" tea party, but their endless nonsense frustrates her so much that she abandons her search and decides to go home. Becoming hopelessly lost in the Tulgey Wood, she breaks down in tears.

The Cheshire Cat reappears and guides her to the royal maze of the tyrannical Queen of Hearts. The Queen forces Alice into a chaotic croquet match using live flamingos as mallets. When the Cheshire Cat plays a prank on the Queen, Alice is blamed and put on trial. The court proceedings are entirely nonsensical, and the furious Queen orders her execution. This prompts a frantic chase where Alice is pursued by all the Wonderland characters. Fleeing through a swirling vortex, she reaches the doorknob, only to see her true self sleeping on the other side. Alice urgently calls out to herself and suddenly wakes up on the riverbank. Realizing the adventure was a dream, she happily heads home for tea with her sister.', '["polite children trying to reason with completely unhinged adults","following animals you definitely should not follow","consuming mysterious food and just hoping for the best","realizing ordinary life is actually preferable to the nonsense"]', 75, 7.184, 'tt0043274', 'A world of wonders in one great picture!', 7.184, 6222, '1951-07-28', 6.9083, 'en', 'Alice in Wonderland', 3000000, 57200000, 'https://movies.disney.com/alice-in-wonderland-1951', 'Released', 'US', '/20cvfwfaFqNbe9Fc3VEHJuPRxmn.jpg', '/tyj0QztA0PkYo6XauifWjkx7UVi.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:01Z', '2026-04-03T19:26:31Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

In 1944, Guido, Giosuè, and Guido''s uncle are forced onto a train to a concentration camp on Giosuè''s birthday. Despite being a Gentile, Dora demands to board the train to stay close to her family, though she is housed in the women''s section. To protect Giosuè from the horrific reality and psychological trauma of their situation, Guido invents a complex fiction, telling his son the camp is a complicated game where prisoners compete for points. He explains the first person to reach 1,000 points wins a real life-sized tank. Guido uses immense creativity and humor to maintain the illusion, interpreting the guards'' harsh orders as game rules and hiding Giosuè from the camp authorities, who systematically murder the children and elderly.

As the war nears its end and Allied forces approach, the camp descends into chaos. The guards begin executing the remaining prisoners and dismantling the camp. Guido tells Giosuè to hide in a sweatbox until everyone has left, promising him this is the game''s final challenge. Guido searches for Dora but is caught by a German soldier. As he is led away to be executed, Guido playfully marches past Giosuè''s hiding spot to keep up the charade. The next morning, American forces arrive to liberate the camp. A real American tank rolls into the compound, which Giosuè believes is his prize. He is soon reunited with his mother, and years later, the adult Giosuè reflects on his father''s ultimate sacrifice.', '["fathers completely refusing to let the world traumatize their kids","the indomitable human spirit disguised as a goofball","husbands who never stop trying to win over their own wives","sacrificing everything without complaining about it once"]', 116, 8.439, 'tt0118799', 'An unforgettable fable that proves love, family and imagination conquer all.', 8.439, 13880, '1997-12-20', 12.8852, 'it', 'La vita è bella', 20000000, 230098753, '', 'Released', 'IT', '/mfnkSeeVOBVheuyn2lo4tfmOPQb.jpg', '/6aNKD81RHR1DqUUa8kOZ1TBY1Lp.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:25Z', '2026-04-03T19:27:04Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Left alone and shunned by the herd, Dumbo finds an unlikely friend in Timothy Q. Mouse. Timothy attempts to make Dumbo a star so he can free his mother. He whispers a suggestion to the sleeping ringmaster to make Dumbo the climax of a daring elephant pyramid stunt. During the performance, Dumbo trips on his ears and knocks over the pyramid, bringing the circus tent down. Dumbo is then relegated to a humiliating role in the clown act, forced to fall from a burning building into a vat of pie filling.

To cheer Dumbo up, Timothy takes him to visit his imprisoned mother. On their way back, the two drink from a bucket of water accidentally spiked with champagne. Inebriated, they hallucinate a parade of singing pink elephants. The next morning, Dumbo and Timothy wake up high in the branches of a tree, surrounded by crows. Timothy realizes that Dumbo must have used his large ears to fly. He passionately defends Dumbo to the crows, sharing the elephant''s tragic story. Moved by the tale, the lead crow provides Timothy with a "magic feather" to give Dumbo the confidence to try flying again.

Clutching the feather, Dumbo jumps from a cliff and successfully flies. Back at the circus, Dumbo prepares for his clown act. As he leaps from the high platform, he loses the feather. Timothy urges him to believe in himself, revealing the feather was only a psychological crutch. Dumbo swoops out of his dive, soaring around the tent and stunning the audience. He becomes an international superstar, Timothy becomes his manager, and Mrs. Jumbo is freed. The film ends with mother and son happily reunited in their own luxurious private train car.', '["moms setting the protective instinct bar terrifyingly high","the real villain is just the general public","you will immediately call your mother after the credits roll","the sheer emotional devastation of an animated lullaby","movies that gave an entire generation the exact same nightmare"]', 64, 6.985, 'tt0033563', 'The One...The Only...The FABULOUS...', 6.985, 5253, '1941-10-31', 5.3163, 'en', 'Dumbo', 812000, 1600000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/4x9FmvdJ464Fg7A9XcbYSmxfVw3.jpg', '/eEKpOowAkVAF3sKJKqY2h4h12GV.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:55Z', '2026-04-03T19:27:43Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Salieri masquerades as a supportive ally while secretly sabotaging Mozart''s career. Mozart struggles with mounting debt, alcoholism, and the pressure of providing for his wife, Constanze. Following the death of Mozart''s overbearing father, Salieri devises a cruel psychological plot. Disguising himself in a terrifying black mask that Mozart''s father once wore, Salieri anonymously commissions a destitute Mozart to write a Requiem mass. Salieri intends to work the fragile composer to death, steal the completed Requiem, and premiere it at Mozart''s funeral, triumphing over God by claiming the divine music as his own.

Driven to exhaustion by juggling the Requiem and his operas, Mozart collapses. On his deathbed, a weakened Mozart dictates the final movements of the mass to Salieri, who is awestruck and struggles to keep pace with the dying man''s frantic genius. Mozart dies before the work is finished and is unceremoniously buried in a pauper''s grave. In the present, Salieri concludes his confession by declaring that God chose to kill Mozart rather than allow Salieri to share in the glory. Condemned to survive his own fame and live a long life in obscurity, Salieri ironically blesses his fellow asylum patients, declaring himself the patron saint of mediocrity.', '["men who should have just gone to confession instead of making it everyone else''s problem","the spiritual danger of being aggressively average and acutely aware of it","proof that divine inspiration does not make you a functional adult","watching someone else receive the exact blessing you spent years praying for","gorgeous historical garments distracting from terrible life choices"]', 160, 8.024, 'tt0086879', 'The Man... The Music... The Madness... The Murder... The Motion Picture.', 8.024, 4694, '1984-09-19', 6.6061, 'en', 'Amadeus', 18000000, 90007557, '', 'Released', 'US', '/gQRfiyfGvr1az0quaYyMram3Aqt.jpg', '/4i3Amppd6eW5Qkhjv4gdHk3CCoE.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:37Z', '2026-04-03T19:27:46Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Six years later, a cynical Raya searches for the fabled last dragon to reverse the curse. She summons Sisu, a cheerful water dragon who reveals she can wield the gem''s powers if she holds its fragments. The duo sets out to recover the remaining pieces from the rival tribes. They recruit a band of survivors who lost their families to the Druun: a young entrepreneur named Boun, a con-artist toddler named Noi, and a formidable giant named Tong. Sisu consistently urges Raya to trust others, a philosophy Raya rejects due to her past betrayal.

To retrieve the final piece, Sisu insists on offering a peace treaty to Namaari. When Namaari ambushes them, Raya attacks, causing Namaari''s crossbow to misfire and kill Sisu. The world''s water dries up, allowing the Druun to overrun Fang. Raya furiously duels Namaari but pauses when she remembers Sisu''s belief in radical trust. Instead of striking the final blow, Raya offers her gem fragment to Namaari and allows the Druun to petrify her. Inspired by her sacrifice, Raya''s companions also surrender their pieces and are consumed. Moved by their faith, Namaari assembles the Dragon Gem before turning to stone. The restored artifact permanently vanquishes the Druun and revives all the petrified victims. The resurrected dragons revive Sisu, and the five tribes finally reunite in peace.', '["dads setting the parenting bar so high it feels like a personal attack","breaking a cycle of revenge because someone has to go first","extending grace to people who absolutely do not deserve it","believing a really good meal can solve deep geopolitical conflict","animal sidekicks that double as public transit"]', 107, 7.8, 'tt5109280', 'A quest to save her world.', 7.8, 7222, '2021-03-03', 7.5639, 'en', 'Raya and the Last Dragon', 100000000, 130423032, 'https://movies.disney.com/raya-and-the-last-dragon', 'Released', 'US', '/5nVhgCzxKbK47OLIKxCR1syulOn.jpg', '/zmX7ObPaRfiCmY6LMalUb1bJDKj.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:37:27Z', '2026-04-03T19:28:24Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

During the tour, Simran frequently crosses paths with Raj, who is traveling after failing his exams. Though they initially clash, they are forced to travel together after missing a train. Their bickering gradually turns into deep affection, and upon returning to London, they realize they are in love. When Baldev learns of Simran''s romance, he is enraged by the perceived betrayal. He immediately moves the family to Punjab to expedite her arranged wedding.

Refusing to give up, Raj follows Simran to India. Advised by his father to win her hand honorably rather than eloping, Raj befriends Kuljeet and infiltrates the wedding preparations. He slowly endears himself to Simran''s extended family through his charm and respect for tradition. Simran''s mother discovers Raj''s identity and offers to help them elope, but Raj refuses, insisting he will only marry Simran with Baldev''s explicit blessing.

Before the wedding, Baldev discovers a photograph from the Europe trip and realizes Raj''s true identity. Feeling deceived, Baldev angrily expels Raj from the house. Raj and his father arrive at the railway station, where they are ambushed by Kuljeet and his friends. After a brief brawl, Baldev arrives and demands that Raj leave India forever. As the train begins to depart, Simran begs her father to let her go. Moved by Raj''s honorable restraint and unwavering devotion to his daughter, Baldev finally relents. He releases Simran''s hand, allowing her to sprint down the platform and catch the moving train to reunite with Raj.', '["couples who refuse to elope because the parents'' blessing actually matters","fathers who spend the entire runtime looking furious because they love their daughters too much","winning over terrifying in-laws through sheer force of charm","sprinting through public transit infrastructure in the name of love"]', 190, 8.516, 'tt0112870', 'Come… Fall In love, All Over Again…', 8.516, 4568, '1995-10-20', 13.5553, 'hi', 'दिलवाले दुल्हनिया ले जायेंगे', 13200000, 100000000, '', 'Released', 'IN', '/2CAL2433ZeIihfX1Hb2139CX0pW.jpg', '/6N5d02quKqMKqvTpOdFmBDy9scY.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:23Z', '2026-04-03T19:28:59Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Refusing to use her birth name, Ponyo argues with her father and declares her desire to become a human girl. The human blood she ingested triggers a transformation, allowing her to grow arms and legs. Fujimoto suppresses her powers and leaves to consult her mother, the sea goddess Gran Mamare. With her sisters'' help, Ponyo breaks free and unleashes her father''s magical elixirs into the ocean. The massive surge of magic turns her fully human but creates a dangerous imbalance in nature, summoning massive prehistoric fish and triggering a tsunami. Ponyo reunites with Sōsuke as the floodwaters isolate his house. Lisa leaves to check on the residents of the senior center where she works.

The next morning, Sōsuke and Ponyo find the land entirely submerged. They use Ponyo''s magic to enlarge a toy boat and set out to find Lisa. They encounter other survivors and eventually locate the senior center, which Gran Mamare has magically protected in an underwater bubble. Gran Mamare informs Fujimoto that the world''s balance can be restored if Sōsuke can pass a test of true love; if he fails, Ponyo will turn into sea foam. Sōsuke accepts Ponyo exactly as she is, whether fish, mermaid, or human. Ponyo gives up her magical powers to remain a human girl, restoring balance to the world.', '["someone cooks and your whole nervous system resets","kids treating mind-bending supernatural events as a completely normal tuesday","overprotective dads doing the absolute most to keep their daughters safe","reminders that the world is actually beautiful and worth saving"]', 100, 7.755, 'tt0876563', 'Welcome to a world where anything is possible.', 7.755, 4751, '2008-07-19', 9.1292, 'ja', '崖の上のポニョ', 34000000, 202404009, 'https://www.ghibli.jp/works/ponyo/', 'Released', 'JP', '/yp8vEZflGynlEylxEesbYasc06i.jpg', '/shqLeIkqPAAXM8iT6wVDiXUYz1p.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:34:13Z', '2026-04-03T19:29:08Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

King Stefan burns all the kingdom''s spinning wheels, but the fairies secretly take Aurora to a woodland cottage to raise her as a peasant named Briar Rose. On her sixteenth birthday, Aurora meets a handsome stranger in the forest. Unaware he is Prince Phillip, she falls in love and invites him to the cottage. Meanwhile, Maleficent''s raven discovers Aurora''s location.

The fairies reveal Aurora''s royal heritage and return her to the castle. Heartbroken about leaving the stranger, Aurora is lured by Maleficent to a hidden tower room. She pricks her finger on a magical spinning wheel and falls asleep. To spare the parents'' grief, the fairies put the entire kingdom to sleep until the spell is broken.

Realizing Phillip is the man from the forest, the fairies discover Maleficent has imprisoned him in her domain, the Forbidden Mountain. They sneak in, free the prince, and arm him with the Sword of Truth and the Shield of Virtue. Phillip rides for the castle, battling through a forest of thorns erected by Maleficent. To stop him, Maleficent transforms into a colossal, fire-breathing dragon. With the fairies'' magical assistance, Phillip throws his sword into the dragon''s heart, killing Maleficent. He reaches Aurora''s chamber and kisses her, breaking the curse. The kingdom awakens, and Aurora and Phillip share a waltz in the ballroom.', '["dads baby-proofing the house to a pathological degree","villains overreacting to minor social slights","godparents who actually take their duties seriously","chivalry being treated like an actual virtue instead of a punchline","hand-drawn animation that makes modern cgi look lazy"]', 75, 6.9, 'tt0053285', 'Awaken to a World of Wonders!', 6.9, 5440, '1959-02-17', 8.3964, 'en', 'Sleeping Beauty', 6000000, 51600000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/n3pxoMDDxp10c1smgbDzW4bwlzq.jpg', '/me67dwJnUBt3O9NqZaBdEQ6i4vM.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:08Z', '2026-04-03T19:29:55Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

McMurphy immediately disrupts the sterile order of the ward. A boisterous anti-authoritarian, he challenges Ratched''s petty rules and encourages the other men—including anxious Harding, stuttering young Billy Bibbit, and the imposing, seemingly deaf-mute Chief Bromden—to reclaim their dignity. McMurphy leads them in acts of rebellion, from demanding to watch the World Series to hijacking a hospital bus for an unauthorized fishing trip. As the patients slowly awaken to their own agency, the battle of wills between McMurphy and Ratched intensifies. McMurphy is shocked to learn that most of the men are voluntarily committed, trapped not by the state but by their own crippling fears.

The conflict reaches a breaking point when McMurphy orchestrates an illicit midnight party on the ward. The rebellion shatters when Ratched discovers the aftermath the next morning. By cruelly threatening to tell Billy''s overbearing mother about his indiscretions, Ratched drives the terrified young man to suicide. Enraged by her callous manipulation, McMurphy violently attacks and nearly strangles Ratched. In retaliation, the hospital administration subjects McMurphy to a lobotomy, permanently destroying his mind. Unwilling to leave his friend trapped in a vegetative state, Chief Bromden smothers McMurphy in a final act of mercy. Empowered by McMurphy''s sacrifice, Bromden tears a heavy hydrotherapy fountain from the floor, hurls it through a barred window, and escapes into the dawn.', '["villains whose primary weapon is a clipboard and a polite tone of voice","friendly reminders to never let the state handle your mental health","men learning how to stand up straight and look people in the eye","flawed men who accidentally become martyrs for their friends"]', 133, 8.412, 'tt0073486', 'In this clean, orderly, disciplined world, who needs guys like McMurphy? Everybody.', 8.412, 11318, '1975-11-19', 13.1198, 'en', 'One Flew Over the Cuckoo''s Nest', 3000000, 108981275, '', 'Released', 'US', '/kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg', '/6Oa3zTiluBz2W8D2ou1MY16dUiF.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:25Z', '2026-04-03T19:31:29Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

After taming the wind and fire spirits, the group discovers their parents'' shipwreck and a map to Ahtohallan, a mythical river of memory. Elsa sends Anna and Olaf away to protect them, then tames the water spirit to reach Ahtohallan. She discovers the voice is her mother''s spirit and learns that King Runeard built the dam to weaken the Northuldra, initiating the ancient conflict by murdering their unarmed leader. Elsa ventures too deep into Ahtohallan to uncover this, freezing solid and causing Olaf to disintegrate. Before freezing, she sends a message to Anna. Realizing the dam must be destroyed to make amends, Anna provokes the massive Earth Giants into smashing the structure. The curse is lifted, but a massive flood rushes toward Arendelle. Elsa thaws, races back on the water spirit, and freezes the floodwaters just in time to save the kingdom. Olaf is revived, Kristoff proposes to Anna, and Anna is crowned Queen of Arendelle, while Elsa remains in the forest to serve as the bridge between humanity and magic.', '["siblings cleaning up the mess their ancestors left behind","men trying to propose but the universe refuses to cooperate","doing the right thing even when you are actively crying","soundtracks that will hold your minivan hostage"]', 103, 7.234, 'tt4520988', 'The past is not what it seems.', 7.234, 10206, '2019-11-20', 10.9886, 'en', 'Frozen II', 150000000, 1453683476, 'https://movies.disney.com/frozen-2', 'Released', 'US', '/mINJaa34MtknCYl5AjtNJzWj8cD.jpg', '/AoSZyb37ljMAxw0RdeQEBHKtgcc.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:37:24Z', '2026-04-03T19:31:05Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

The squad navigates war-torn France, suffering casualties along the way. Caparzo is killed by a sniper in Neuville, and the medic Wade is mortally wounded taking a German machine-gun position. Against his men''s wishes, Miller releases a surviving German prisoner. Tensions rise and nearly spark a mutiny, but Miller diffuses the situation by revealing his civilian life as a schoolteacher, emphasizing his desire to complete the mission and return to his wife.

The squad finally locates Ryan outside Ramelle, where he is defending a vital bridge. Informed of his brothers'' deaths and his orders to go home, Ryan refuses to abandon his fellow paratroopers. Miller decides to keep his men in Ramelle to help defend the bridge against an impending German counterattack. During the fierce battle, the outnumbered Americans take heavy losses. Most of Miller''s squad is killed, and Miller himself is mortally wounded just before American reinforcements secure the area. With his dying breaths, Miller tells Ryan to "earn this." Decades later, an elderly Ryan visits Miller''s grave at the Normandy American Cemetery. Accompanied by his family, he asks his wife for reassurance that he has lived a good life, hoping to justify the profound sacrifices the men made to save him.', '["doing the objectively right thing even when it makes absolutely zero tactical sense","living a good life to honor the enormous price someone else paid for it","movies dads will watch in absolute silence if they find it playing on cable","men being completely terrified but doing their duty anyway"]', 169, 8.2, 'tt0120815', 'The mission is a man.', 8.2, 17013, '1998-07-24', 13.3602, 'en', 'Saving Private Ryan', 70000000, 481840909, '', 'Released', 'US', '/uqx37cS8cpHg8U35f9U5IBlrCV3.jpg', '/rW2xRFlJRbTnBJlQTSjQmjevIwb.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:27Z', '2026-04-03T19:31:39Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Lady''s life is disrupted when Darling becomes pregnant. Tramp passes by and warns Lady that once the baby arrives, the dog will be cast aside. After the baby is born, Jim and Darling take a trip, leaving Aunt Sarah in charge. Aunt Sarah brings her mischievous Siamese cats, Si and Am, who deliberately wreck the house and frame Lady. Believing Lady is vicious, Aunt Sarah takes her to a pet shop to buy a muzzle. Terrified, Lady flees and is pursued by stray dogs. Tramp rescues her and takes her to the zoo, tricking a beaver into removing the muzzle. Tramp then shows Lady his carefree lifestyle, culminating in a romantic spaghetti dinner at Tony''s restaurant.

The next morning, Lady is caught by the dogcatcher. At the pound, other strays reveal Tramp''s history of romancing and abandoning female dogs. Aunt Sarah eventually claims Lady, chaining her in the backyard. When Tramp arrives to apologize, Lady angrily confronts him. Suddenly, a large rat sneaks into the house and enters the baby''s room. Lady barks frantically, prompting Tramp to enter the house. He fights and kills the rat but accidentally knocks over the baby''s crib. Aunt Sarah discovers Tramp, locks him in a closet, and calls the pound.

Jim and Darling return just as the dogcatcher departs. Lady leads Jim to the dead rat, proving Tramp''s heroism. Jock and Trusty chase the dogcatcher''s wagon to save Tramp. They stop the wagon, but it tips over, crushing Trusty. The following Christmas, Tramp has been adopted, and he and Lady are raising a litter of puppies. Jock arrives with a recovering Trusty to celebrate.', '["bad boys who immediately fold the second they experience a stable home life","redemption arcs that culminate in fighting a home invader","meals that make you want to get married","the inherent dignity of the family dog"]', 76, 7.1, 'tt0048280', 'She''s from the leash and license set... he''s footloose and collar free!', 7.1, 5599, '1955-06-22', 5.0498, 'en', 'Lady and the Tramp', 4000000, 36359037, '', 'Released', 'US', '/340NcWz9SQXWQyf4oicMxjbrLOb.jpg', '/yGgEg4yimYQJLZrZg3Qhogp2raQ.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:36:05Z', '2026-04-03T19:32:10Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Her business experiences various ups and downs, forcing Kiki to navigate difficult customers, harsh weather, and self-doubt. She catches the attention of Tombo, an aviation-obsessed local boy who admires her flying abilities. Despite Kiki''s initial aloofness, the two eventually bond over their shared love of flight. However, the pressures of her new life and a growing sense of isolation take their toll. Kiki suddenly loses her magical abilities; she can no longer fly, and Jiji''s speech is reduced to ordinary cat meows.

Depressed and adrift, Kiki is visited by Ursula, a young artist she previously met during a delivery in the forest. Ursula shares her own experiences with creative burnout, advising Kiki to take a break and find her own unique purpose rather than forcing her magic. Shortly after returning to Koriko, Kiki witnesses a massive dirigible accident that leaves Tombo dangling perilously in mid-air. Desperate to save her friend, Kiki borrows a push-broom from a bystander and regains enough of her magical focus to fly and rescue him. Rejuvenated by her success and newly confident in her abilities, Kiki resumes her delivery service and becomes a beloved member of the Koriko community.', '["someone cooks and your whole nervous system resets","husbands who speak entirely in acts of service","gentle reminders that burnout is real and resting is a virtue","movies that make you want to open a small business and sweep the front porch"]', 103, 7.833, 'tt0097814', 'I was feeling blue, but I''m better now.', 7.833, 4507, '1989-07-29', 10.6799, 'ja', '魔女の宅急便', 6900000, 4493017, 'https://gkids.com/films/kikis-delivery-service', 'Released', 'JP', '/Aufa4YdZIv4AXpR9rznwVA5SEfd.jpg', '/h5pAEVma835u8xoE60kmLVopLct.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:34:08Z', '2026-04-03T19:32:51Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

James and Kat move into Whipstaff, where Casper quickly befriends Kat while James attempts to psychoanalyze the ghostly trio. As Casper spends time with Kat, he regains memories of his past life, recalling that he died of pneumonia as a boy and chose to remain a ghost to keep his grieving father company. He shows Kat his father''s secret invention, the Lazarus, a machine designed to bring the dead back to life. Upon learning about the device, Carrigan steals the formula and intentionally kills herself, plotting to use her ghost form to phase into the vault, steal the treasure, and resurrect herself. However, the treasure turns out to be Casper''s childhood baseball, and Carrigan is tricked into crossing over into the afterlife.

During the chaos, James accidentally falls to his death and becomes a ghost. Faced with a difficult choice, Casper sacrifices his only chance to become human again, using the last of the Lazarus formula to resurrect James instead. Touched by Casper''s selflessness, the spirit of Amelia appears as an angel. She grants Casper a temporary wish, turning him into a living boy until ten o''clock so he can dance with Kat at her Halloween party. As the clock strikes ten, Casper reverts to his ghost form, scaring away the partygoers. Ultimately, Kat, James, Casper, and his uncles find peace, continuing to live together as an unconventional family in the mansion.', '["widower dads doing their absolute best","children''s movies that will force you to explain death to your kids","moms fixing everything from beyond the grave","halloween movies for people who hate being scared","real estate that should be condemned but builds character"]', 100, 6.3, 'tt0112642', 'Seeing is believing.', 6.3, 4885, '1995-05-26', 6.5409, 'en', 'Casper', 50000000, 287928194, '', 'Released', 'US', '/2ah8fNJFZVU3vcXhU5xfAYi2eym.jpg', '/sQPckU0TfSeYIlUneHfIXwzQC2f.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:06Z', '2026-04-03T19:33:46Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

Returning home, Stark announces that his company will cease manufacturing weapons, dismaying his father''s old partner, Obadiah Stane. In his workshop, Stark secretly develops an advanced version of his armor. When he learns the Ten Rings are using his weapons to attack Yinsen''s village, Stark dons his new armor, flies to Afghanistan, and defeats the terrorists.

Stark''s assistant, Pepper Potts, discovers that Stane secretly hired the Ten Rings to assassinate Stark. Stane, having recovered the prototype suit, reverse-engineers it into a massive exoskeleton. He ambushes Stark, paralyzes him, and steals his chest reactor to power the new suit. Stark manages to install his older, weaker reactor and intercepts Stane. The two battle atop the Stark Industries building. Outmatched, Stark instructs Potts to overload the large arc reactor powering the facility. The electrical surge knocks Stane into the exploding reactor, killing him. The next day, Stark publicly reveals his superhero identity at a press conference, declaring, "I am Iron Man."', '["men tinkering in garages until they become better people","finally using your god-given talents to help others instead of showing off","a masterclass in taking personal responsibility for your past mistakes","side characters whose quiet bravery changes the course of history"]', 126, 7.656, 'tt0371746', 'Heroes aren''t born. They''re built.', 7.656, 27909, '2008-04-30', 22.6176, 'en', 'Iron Man', 140000000, 585174222, 'https://www.marvel.com/movies/iron-man', 'Released', 'US', '/78lPtwv72eTNqFW9COBYI0dWDJa.jpg', '/cKvDv2LpwVEqbdXWoQl4XgGN6le.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:26Z', '2026-04-03T19:34:13Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

On Sara''s birthday, Miss Minchin learns Captain Crewe was reportedly killed in action and his assets seized. Left penniless, Sara is stripped of her belongings, moved to a dreary attic, and forced into servitude alongside Becky. Despite her bleak circumstances and Miss Minchin''s cruelty, Sara maintains her spirit, insisting that all girls are inherently princesses and comforting Becky with her storytelling.

Meanwhile, wealthy neighbor Charles Randolph takes in a wounded, amnesiac soldier. Randolph''s servant, Ram Dass, observes Sara and Becky across the street. Moved by their plight, he sneaks over the roof to secretly transform their attic with lavish furnishings and warm food.

When Miss Minchin discovers the altered room, she locks the girls inside and calls the police. Sara and Becky escape across a narrow board bridging their building with the Randolph home. Inside, Sara encounters the amnesiac soldier and instantly recognizes him as her father. Though he initially does not know her, Sara''s desperate pleas trigger his memories, leading to a joyful reunion. Captain Crewe recovers his fortune and adopts Becky, while a disgraced Miss Minchin is reduced to working as a chimney sweep for a boy she previously mistreated. Sara and her family then return to India.', '["dads setting the parenting bar so high it feels like a personal attack","girls who refuse to let the world make them cruel","using storytelling as a legitimate survival tactic","adults who desperately need to go to confession"]', 97, 7.6, 'tt0113670', 'No miracle is ever too small.', 7.6, 1029, '1995-05-10', 2.6223, 'en', 'A Little Princess', 17000000, 10000000, '', 'Released', 'US', '/9V4bAVEskSNbEqjVI0YmeuB0n8I.jpg', '/tcMVpjdEpsXrbPtVrSmh4uDBSiy.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:34:54Z', '2026-04-03T19:34:55Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

With Vito hospitalized, his volatile eldest son, Sonny, takes command. When Sollozzo attempts a second assassination in the hospital, Michael thwarts it. Realizing the danger will not pass, Michael volunteers to assassinate Sollozzo and his corrupt police ally, Captain McCluskey. Michael kills them at a Bronx restaurant and flees to Sicily, while a violent gang war erupts in New York. In Sicily, Michael marries a local woman, Apollonia, but she is soon killed by a car bomb intended for him. Meanwhile, Sonny is ambushed and brutally murdered at a highway toll booth.

A grieving Vito recovers and calls a summit of the Five Families, brokering a peace to ensure Michael''s safe return. Michael comes home, marries Kay, and gradually assumes control of the family business. Following Vito''s death from a heart attack, Michael orchestrates the simultaneous murders of all rival gang leaders and internal traitors during the baptism of Connie''s infant son. Having consolidated his absolute power, Michael lies to Kay about his involvement in the killings. The film ends as Michael''s capos pledge their loyalty to him as the new Don, shutting the office door on Kay.', '["protecting your family by destroying your soul","attending a sacrament but completely missing the point","pasta sauce recipes disguised as cinema","movies that require an intermission and a charcuterie board"]', 175, 8.687, 'tt0068646', 'An offer you can''t refuse.', 8.687, 22684, '1972-03-14', 34.0623, 'en', 'The Godfather', 6000000, 245066411, 'http://www.thegodfather.com/', 'Released', 'US', '/3bhkrj58Vtu7enYsRolD1fZdja1.jpg', '/tSPT36ZKlP2WVHJLM4cQPLSzv3b.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:22Z', '2026-04-03T19:35:20Z') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title = excluded.title, tmdb_id = excluded.tmdb_id, year = excluded.year, overview = excluded.overview, plot = excluded.plot, shelf_suggestions = excluded.shelf_suggestions, runtime = excluded.runtime, rating = excluded.rating, imdb_id = excluded.imdb_id, tagline = excluded.tagline, vote_average = excluded.vote_average, vote_count = excluded.vote_count, release_date = excluded.release_date, popularity = excluded.popularity, original_language = excluded.original_language, original_title = excluded.original_title, budget = excluded.budget, revenue = excluded.revenue, homepage = excluded.homepage, status = excluded.status, origin_country = excluded.origin_country, poster_key = excluded.poster_key, backdrop_key = excluded.backdrop_key, created_at = excluded.created_at, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;

